Package: qtlpost
Type: Package
Title: Downstream Analysis of QTLtools cis-QTL Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lyra", "Sheu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "140650222+lyrasheu21@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Functions for working with the standard outputs of the qtl-pipeline
    Snakemake workflow (or any QTLtools cis results): reading and annotating
    permutation/nominal output, per-group q-values, covariate assembly,
    colocalisation with GWAS (coloc), MAGMA gene sets, pi1 replication in eQTL
    resources, mediation analysis, and summary / locus plots.
